'''Storm Call''' is a [[Skyrim:shout|shout]] that summons a storm of thunder and lightning. The lightning hits targets randomly and may hit friendly NPCs, who may be killed by the strikes, but will not hit you. The more words of the shout used, the longer the storm and the more powerful the lightning bolts. The third word also increases the area of effect. This shout only works outside, but does work in [[Skyrim:Blackreach|Blackreach]], the [[Skyrim:Soul Cairn|Soul Cairn]], and the outdoor areas of [[Skyrim:Apocrypha|Apocrypha]].

